      "content": "<columns>\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n[https://www.flickr.com/photos/kirbyurner/54277976945/](https://www.flickr.com/photos/kirbyurner/54277976945/)\n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suQWY5DS](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suQWY5DS) \n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\nOn 10-29-2024, DAF exported the photos and voice memo’s from the Fuller Feedback Systems telegram channel. [Archiving](https://coda.io/d/Education-Knowledge-Engineering_doO72TniKUt/Archives-Checklists_sudtpoN9). \n\n\n</columns>\n\ni would very much appreciate help to translate it to dozenal🙏\n\n\n\nExample of Spherical Numbers (275 rows)\n\n",
